/T (The kiosk is designed with user comfort and accessibility in mind. Features such as a semi-private curtain area for professional photos help reduce awkwardness and pressure, allowing users to feel more relaxed and confident in front of the camera. At the same time, playful features like meme generation encourage creativity and social interaction, making the kiosk suitable for both individual and group use.)
/E (The kiosk is designed with user comfort and accessibility in mind. Features such as a semi-private curtain area for professional photos help reduce awkwardness and pressure, allowing users to feel more relaxed and confident in front of the camera. At the same time, playful features like meme generation encourage creativity and social interaction, making the kiosk suitable for both individual and group use.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [4]
>>
