/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 202 0 R
/E (The kiosk adopts a tall, vertical form factor to naturally frame users at eye level, making it suitable for both individual and group photos. The rounded edges and soft pastel colour palette reflect a friendly, student-oriented identity while maintaining a clean and professional appearance that aligns with the ICT school environment. The compact footprint allows the kiosk to be placed in high-traffic campus areas without obstructing movement.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [3]
>>
